  //（锚点/转轴取自所拣圆柱/平面 → 取代旧 'joint' 命令嘅 componentCenter + 硬编码轴估算）。transient 态，唔入撤销快照。
  jointPickMode: boolean
  jointPick: { compId: string; face: MateFace } | null   // 第一拣（父件/接地边）暂存
  startJointPick: () => void
  cancelJointPick: () => void
  pickFaceForJoint: (compId: string, face: MateFace) => void
  // Persistent directed mates: A drives B. aFace/bFace stored in each part's LOCAL frame so they move with it.
  mates: { id: string; aComp: string; bComp: string; aFace: MateFace; bFace: MateFace; flip: boolean; gap: number }[]
  mateErrors: Record<string, { dist: number; angle: number }>   // S 配合残差诊断（最终位姿错位 mm/°）— 过约束/冲突时 >0，resolveMates 量度（视图态）
  resolveMates: () => void
  solveMates: (opts?: { pin?: string }) => void   // #13：3D 闭环 mate 同时求解（拖一件全链跟随 + 过约束诊断；grounded/pin 固定）
  clearMates: () => void
